      "text": "1. Representatie in het\ncontract: zoeken via de\nFHIR API, los van de opslag",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "IikaVBplQsHKOZEE2RSdF",
      "originalText": "1. Representatie in het\ncontract: zoeken via de\nFHIR API, los van de opslag",
